    "detailed_description": "Spy Robot: Gateways To Humanity is a single player action FPS game with hacking, stealth and flight elements in a procedurally generated cyberpunk world with VR support.<br><br>You are the Spy Robot flying on your trusty hoverbike to rescue the remains of the human race scattered throughout the galaxy and solve an ancient mystery.<br><br>Find the cryo chambers in every location and bring them to safety.<br><br>Different hacks can be looted to help you<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Shrink - Use it to shrink cryochambers or enemies for a period of time and collect them<br></li><li> Sleep - Put enemy robots into sleep mode for a period of time<br></li><li> Betrayal - Let enemy robots fight for you for a certain amount of time<br></li><li> Logic Bomb - Cause enemies or other devices to explode after a short time</li></ul><br>Weapon and tools can be found<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gravity gun - to move enemies out of the way<br></li><li> Gateway gun - to open new gateways at gateway nodes<br></li><li> Hack Tool - To upload your hacks to enemies or devices<br></li><li> Pistol - Simple but reliable</li></ul>",
